<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Section 6: Checklist & Summary | Astro Rebuild Plan</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #000000; }
        .dark body { background-color: #000000; color: #FFFFFF; }
        .prose { color: inherit; max-width: 75ch; }
        .prose h1, .prose h2, .prose h3, .prose h4, .prose strong { color: inherit; }
        .prose p, .prose li { color: inherit; opacity: 0.9; @apply text-lg leading-relaxed; }
        .prose a { color: #2563EB; } .dark .prose a { color: #60A5FA; }
        .prose code { @apply rounded-md px-1.5 py-1 text-base; background-color: #F3F4F6; color: #111827; } .dark .prose code { background-color: #1F2937; color: #F9FAFB; }
        .table { border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; } .dark .table { border: 1px solid #374151; }
        .table th, .table td { border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0; } .dark .table th, .dark .table td { border-bottom: 1px solid #374151; }
        .header-text { color: #000000; } .dark .header-text { color: #FFFFFF; }
        .subheader-text { color: #4A5568; } .dark .subheader-text { color: #A0AEC0; }
        .accent-text { color: #2563EB; } .dark .accent-text { color: #60A5FA; }
        .footer { border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0; } .dark .footer { border-top: 1px solid #374151; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-10 sm:py-16">
        <header class="mb-12">
            <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center accent-text hover:underline mb-6 font-semibold">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path></svg>
                Back to Main Index
            </a>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold accent-text tracking-wider uppercase">Section 6</p>
            <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold header-text leading-tight mt-1">Final Recommendations & Checklist</h1>
            <h2 class="text-xl subheader-text mt-3">Bringing It All Together</h2>
        </header>
        <main class="prose mx-auto">
            <article>
                <h3>6.1 Summary of Our Strategic Approach</h3>
                <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2">
                    <li><strong>Embrace the Astro Way:</strong> Work with Astro's static-first, island-based architecture, not against it.</li>
                    <li><strong>Build Static First:</strong> Develop the complete HTML and CSS structure of the site before introducing any client-side interactivity.</li>
                    <li><strong>Add Interactivity in Isolated Islands:</strong> Use the appropriate animation strategies and <code>client:*</code> directives to enhance specific components.</li>
                    <li><strong>Automate Deployment:</strong> Leverage GitHub Actions for a reliable and repeatable CI/CD pipeline.</li>
                </ol>
                <h3>6.2 The Definitive Rebuild Checklist</h3>
                <div class="my-8 overflow-x-auto">
                    <table class="min-w-full table rounded-lg">
                        <thead class="text-left">
                           <tr>
                                <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Phase</th>
                                <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Key Actions</th>
                           </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                           <tr>
                                <td class="px-6 py-4 align-top font-semibold">Setup</td>
                                <td class="px-6 py-4"><ul class="list-disc space-y-2"><li>Initialize new Astro project ("Empty" template).</li><li>Initialize Git and connect to a new GitHub repo.</li><li>Configure <code>astro.config.mjs</code> with <code>site</code>, <code>base</code>, and <code>output: 'static'</code>.</li></ul></td>
                           </tr>
                           <tr>
                                <td class="px-6 py-4 align-top font-semibold">Build</td>
                                <td class="px-6 py-4"><ul class="list-disc space-y-2"><li>Develop all pages and layouts with only HTML & CSS first.</li><li>Choose an appropriate animation strategy for each requirement.</li><li>Implement animations as isolated islands using <code>client:*</code> directives.</li></ul></td>
                           </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td class="px-6 py-4 align-top font-semibold">Deploy</td>
                                <td class="px-6 py-4"><ul class="list-disc space-y-2"><li>Set GitHub Pages source to "GitHub Actions" in repo settings.</li><li>Create the <code>.github/workflows/deploy.yml</code> file.</li><li>Commit and push the workflow file to trigger deployment.</li></ul></td>
                           </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </article>
        </main>
        <footer class="text-center py-8 mt-12 footer">
            <p class="text-sm subheader-text">Astro Rebuild Guide | Section 6</p>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
